abstract: >-
  Framework under development; not ready for implementation.
  Robotics Information Modelling (RoIM) is a framework for robot-ready BIM:
  four pillars, five readiness levels (R0-R4) and a draft IFC property set,
  Pset_RobotReadiness, aligned with ISO 19650 and IDS.
